msgid "Quit Heroes of Might and Magic II and return to the operating system."
msgstr "退出魔法门之英雄无敌 II 并返回操作系统。"

msgid "Load a previously saved game."
msgstr "读取之前保存的游戏。"

msgid "View the credits screen."
msgstr "查看制作人员名单。"

msgid "View the high scores screen."
msgstr "查看英雄榜。"

msgid "Start a single or multi-player game."
msgstr "开始单人或多人游戏。"

msgid "Create new or modify existing maps."
msgstr "创建新地图或修改现有地图。"

msgid "Change language, resolution and settings of the game."
msgstr "更改游戏语言、分辨率和设置。"

msgid "A single player game playing out a single map."
msgstr "单人游戏，游玩单张地图。"

msgid "A single player game playing through a series of maps."
msgstr "单人游戏，游玩一系列连续地图。"

msgid "A multi-player game, with several human players competing against each other on a single map."
msgstr "多人游戏，多名玩家在一张地图上相互对抗。"

msgid "Setup and play a battle without loading any map."
msgstr "无需加载地图，直接设置并进行一场战斗。"

msgid "Either Roland's or Archibald's campaign from the original Heroes of Might and Magic II."
msgstr "原版英雄无敌 II 中罗兰德或阿基巴德的战役。"

msgid "One of the four new campaigns from the Price of Loyalty expansion set."
msgstr "忠诚的代价资料片中的四个新战役之一。"

msgid "Play with 2 human players, and optionally, up to 4 additional computer players."
msgstr "2 名人类玩家对战，可选最多 4 名电脑玩家。"

msgid "Play with 3 human players, and optionally, up to 3 additional computer players."
msgstr "3 名人类玩家对战，可选最多 3 名电脑玩家。"

msgid "Play with 4 human players, and optionally, up to 2 additional computer players."
msgstr "4 名人类玩家对战，可选最多 2 名电脑玩家。"

msgid "Play with 5 human players, and optionally, up to 1 additional computer player."
msgstr "5 名人类玩家对战，可选最多 1 名电脑玩家。"

msgid "Play with 6 human players."
msgstr "6 名人类玩家对战。"

